  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon vegetable oil",
    "2 tablespoons diced onion",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "2 tablespoons chopped green chiles (such as Ortega®)",
    "2 tablespoons Mexican-style hot tomato sauce (such as El Pato®)",
    "1 cup shredded rotisserie chicken",
    "0.5 cup shredded Mexican cheese blend",
    "2 tablespoons Neufchâtel cheese",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "6 corn tortillas",
    "avocado oil cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p9bQvk4cln_EFllL63ZnM3BEuRw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279015-air-fryer-chicken-taquitos-DDMFS-330-4x3-step-01-0027f31c5a6d48f983d1611f73a2880c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279015/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook until soft and translucent, 3 to 5 minutes. Add garlic; cook until fragrant, about 1 minute. Add green chiles and Mexican tomato sauce; stir to combine. Add shredded chicken, Mexican cheese blend, and Neufchâtel cheese. Cook and stir until cheeses have melted and mixture is warmed through, about 3 minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AU4qexGPe3Vn7EY6cjqf38-PhhI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279015-air-fryer-chicken-taquitos-DDMFS-332-4x3-step-02-b084a93667e541a3996fdc2713e2a71c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279015/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat tortillas in a skillet or directly on the grates of a gas stove until soft and pliable. Place 3 tablespoons of chicken mixture down the center of each tortilla. Fold over and roll into taquitos.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kh9hWBiWsUJ0S6jSR2PP0QEq2lU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279015-air-fryer-chicken-taquitos-DDMFS-333-4x3-step-03-4b35abd4b9174d7bb3a5cc399d525f80.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279015/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Place taquitos in a single layer in the air fryer basket, making sure they are not touching, and mist with avocado oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y_fscO4r3L2x3nnlWvPg6H9-hv0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279015-air-fryer-chicken-taquitos-DDMFS-336-4x3-step-04-2a5fc43cea2a4cefa2b6290dc84554fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279015/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook until golden brown, 6 to 9 minutes. Turn taquitos over, mist with avocado oil, and air fry until crispy, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/upRzvbFbLz_lswSqmdUD-5g8VLo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279015-air-fryer-chicken-taquitos-DDMFS-346-4x3-step-05-01b3964da1da43398d762b6e17fa782b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279015/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
